# raft_db API Manager - Bruno Collection
# Import this into Bruno (https://www.usebruno.com/) to test the API manager

@BASE_URL = http://localhost:8080

### Health Check - GET
GET {{BASE_URL}}/health/3000
### Health Check - POST
POST {{BASE_URL}}/health/3000

### Values Redirect - GET
GET {{BASE_URL}}/values/3000

### Command Redirect - POST
POST {{BASE_URL}}/command/3000

